  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Proyecto de Apoyo a la Sostenibilidad y Equidad del Transporte Pblico</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainability and Equity of Public Transport Support Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es apoyar la accesibilidad sostenible en transporte pblico de la poblacin vulnerable a servicios pblicos de salud y educacin, y a mercados de trabajo. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) apoyar la asequibilidad del Transporte Pblico Automotor (TPA) para la poblacin vulnerable en Argentina; y (ii) mejorar la sostenibilidad del sistema de TPA en el AMBA.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to support sustainable accessibility in public transportation for the vulnerable population to public health and education services, and to labor markets. The specific objectives are: (i) to support the affordability of Motor Public Transport (TPA) for the vulnerable population in Argentina; and (ii) to improve the sustainability of the TPA system in the AMBA.</narrative>
  </description>
